  "model": "gpt-6.1-sol",
  "createdAt": "2026-10-16T15:14:58.260836Z",
  "updatedAt": "2026-10-16T20:04:54.353021Z",
  "totalBlocks": 35,
  "translatedBlocks": 35,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "58c8f3e7410e4871",
      "translationZh": "今天，我们正式在 Hub 的模型页面上直接集成四家出色的无服务器推理服务提供商（Inference Providers）：fal、Replicate、Sambanova 和 Together AI。它们还无缝集成到了我们的客户端 SDK（支持 JS 和 Python）中，让你能够比以往更轻松地探索各种模型的无服务器推理，并使用你喜爱的服务提供商来运行这些模型。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "beffaf9db5e9ebaf",
      "translationZh": "我们在 Hub 上托管无服务器 Inference API 已经很久了（我们在 2020 年夏天推出了 v1——哇，时间过得真快 🤯）。虽然这让探索和原型开发变得轻松，但我们已将核心价值主张进一步聚焦于与社区一起开展大型数据集和模型的协作、存储、版本管理和分发。与此同时，无服务器服务提供商蓬勃发展，Hugging Face 通过一批优秀的服务提供商，为用户提供便捷、统一的无服务器推理访问方式，时机已然成熟。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "80fff0cc03dd57fa",
      "translationZh": "正如我们与 AWS、Nvidia 等优秀合作伙伴携手，通过模型页面上的 Deploy 按钮提供专用部署选项一样，与新一代无服务器推理服务提供商合作，提供以模型为中心的无服务器推理服务，也是顺理成章的事。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "54e24bafee238b50",
      "translationZh": "以 DeepSeek-ai/DeepSeek-R1 这个正当其时的例子来看看这项集成能实现什么——这个模型在过去几天里已声名大噪，进入大众视野 🔥：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "da5d27fea959f3a7",
      "translationZh": "SambaNova 联合创始人兼首席执行官 Rodrigo Liang：“我们很高兴与 Hugging Face 合作，加速其 Inference API。Hugging Face 开发者现在可以在众多顶尖开源模型上获得快得多的推理速度。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "72c4e51d7cbb4e8b",
      "translationZh": "Replicate 创始设计师 Zeke Sikelianos：“Hugging Face 是开源模型权重事实上的大本营，也一直是在推动 AI 走向全球、让更多人能够使用 AI 方面发挥关键作用的平台。在 Replicate 内部，我们将 Hugging Face 作为首选的权重注册中心；能成为此次发布中首批亮相的推理服务提供商之一，我们深感荣幸。”",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "70b054b41dc6913d",
      "translationZh": "这仅仅是个开始，未来几周，我们将与社区一起在此基础上继续构建！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "9c870aa6e5e93270",
      "translationZh": "工作原理",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "81081802da8646bb",
      "translationZh": "在网站用户界面中",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "71d763e2913402e9",
      "translationZh": "在用户账户设置中，你可以：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "62a314a3ad30bce8",
      "translationZh": "为你已注册的服务提供商设置自己的 API 密钥。否则，你仍然可以使用这些服务提供商——你的请求将通过 HF 路由。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ec3f4cb2fd87598a",
      "translationZh": "按偏好对服务提供商排序。这会应用于模型页面中的小组件和代码片段。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "edffd45559e7497c",
      "translationZh": "正如我们提到的，调用推理 API 时有两种模式：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "a68932ccf1f45a31",
      "translationZh": "自定义密钥（使用你自己的、对应推理服务提供商的 API 密钥，直接向该推理服务提供商发起调用）；或者",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "43848c3df5d9232d",
      "translationZh": "由 HF 路由（在这种情况下，你不需要服务提供商的令牌，费用会直接计入你的 HF 账户，而非服务提供商账户）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d7ae8780922d4fe1",
      "translationZh": "模型页面会展示第三方推理服务提供商（与当前模型兼容的服务提供商，按用户偏好排序）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "be0d888d38854a72",
      "translationZh": "通过客户端 SDK",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fbb48338870abf08",
      "translationZh": "在 Python 中使用 huggingface_hub",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1fe8d0d6ea297e80",
      "translationZh": "以下示例展示了如何使用 Together AI 作为推理提供商来使用 DeepSeek-R1。你可以使用 Hugging Face 令牌，通过 Hugging Face 自动路由请求；如果你有自己的 Together AI API 密钥，也可以使用它。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a96503454e72e9fb",
      "translationZh": "安装 v0.28.0 或更高版本的 huggingface_hub（发行说明）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "10640c2230e7080e",
      "translationZh": "注意：你也可以使用 OpenAI 客户端库调用推理提供商（Inference Providers）；有关 DeepSeek 模型的示例，请参见此处。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0a05f94a71bee21b",
      "translationZh": "下面展示如何使用在 fal.ai 上运行的 FLUX.1-dev，根据文本提示生成图像：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "97ec45d837a32b9d",
      "translationZh": "要切换到其他提供商，只需更改提供商名称，其余内容保持不变：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "11a638239fb39f43",
      "translationZh": "在 JS 中使用 @huggingface/inference",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "06b51eaea02d859b",
      "translationZh": "通过 HTTP 调用",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "910f54cf8f3306b3",
      "translationZh": "我们直接在 huggingface.co 域名下提供路由代理，方便你直接调用。例如，这对于兼容 OpenAI 的 API 非常有用。你只需将基础 URL 替换为：https://router.huggingface.co/{:provider}。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b767fea5f8512039",
      "translationZh": "下面介绍如何通过 cURL，以 Sambanova 为推理提供商调用 Llama-3.3-70B-Instruct。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "3ac8bbca9a74cfbd",
      "translationZh": "计费",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "95e460558544d440",
      "translationZh": "对于直接请求，即使用推理提供商密钥发起的请求，由相应提供商向你计费。例如，如果你使用 Together AI 密钥，费用就会计入你的 Together AI 账户。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b1bad9f1cfe36bbf",
      "translationZh": "对于路由请求，即通过 hub 进行身份验证时，你只需按提供商的标准 API 费率付费。我们不会额外加价，只会直接转收提供商的费用。（未来，我们可能会与提供商合作伙伴达成收入分成协议。）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "267e8c36449a9380",
      "translationZh": "重要提示 ‼️ PRO 用户每月可获得价值 $2 的推理额度。你可以跨提供商使用这些额度。🔥",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9e2ea1d08ca3f42b",
      "translationZh": "订阅 Hugging Face PRO 计划，即可享受推理额度、ZeroGPU、Spaces Dev Mode、提高至 20 倍的限额等更多权益。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f78dc149c1ec0490",
      "translationZh": "我们还为已登录的免费用户提供少量免费推理额度，但如果条件允许，请升级到 PRO！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "c625dbaf508de2f3",
      "translationZh": "反馈与后续步骤",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "19cab62412ae504f",
      "translationZh": "我们非常期待收到你的反馈！你可以在这个 Hub 讨论帖中留言：https://huggingface.co/spaces/huggingface/HuggingDiscussions/discussions/49",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    }
  ],
